{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If the robot sees the object, approach it. If not, scan the area. Take the object, do the task and return it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = PutObjectBack    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = DoTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />\"",
